  [4] Enter the bedroom
      proof: The bedroom is centered in the view after crossing the threshold.
  [5] Walk forward to the rug
      proof: The rug is directly ahead of the camera, within a step.
  [6] Stop on the rug
      proof: The camera is positioned on the rug and it fills the central view
